{"flow": "review-hints", "desc": "09 的提示类判断: 把候选切成单元 (diff hunk, What to build 条目, 验收标准) 逐条问判断模型, 阈值以上的提示交作者核实. 不产生关卡结论.", "entry": "once", "returns": {"clear": "没有要处理的提示", "changed": "作者修正了候选, 需要重新暂存"}}
{"id": "once", "type": "program", "desc": "每轮只提示一次, 防止修正后反复提示.", "primitive": "instance.once", "args": {"key": "hints:$state.round"}, "next": {"first": "cut", "again": "return:clear"}}
{"id": "cut", "type": "program", "desc": "按单元乘检查项出题.", "primitive": "review.cutUnits", "args": {"roles": ["requirements-reviewer", "code-standards-reviewer"]}, "next": {"units": "ask-judge", "none": "return:clear"}}
{"id": "ask-judge", "type": "judgment", "desc": "阈值以下不提示, 也不交高智能 Agent (D16).", "next": {"flagged": "verify", "clear": "return:clear"}, "kind": "noul", "category": "precheck", "forEach": "$result.cut.units", "aggregate": {"flagged": "any above threshold", "clear": "none above threshold or empty"}, "template": "{unit} 是否违反检查项 {checkItem}?", "state": ["$item.unit", "$item.checkItem"], "options": ["flagged", "clear"]}
{"id": "verify", "type": "agent", "desc": "作者核实提示.", "work": "author", "next": {"fixed": "return:changed", "all-invalid": "return:clear", "ask-user:stop": "return:clear"}, "write": {"scope": "instance"}, "instruction": "判断模型提示以下单元可能有问题. 逐条核实: 成立的修正, 不成立的跳过. 提示不是 Reviewer 结论.", "inputs": ["$result.ask-judge.flagged"], "output": {"branch": ["fixed", "all-invalid", "ask-user"], "fields": {"question": "string?"}}}
